WEBVTT

00:20.350 --> 00:24.390
♪ As flowers bloom and wither ♪

00:24.390 --> 00:30.090
♪ May we pass by the magnificent scenery ♪

00:30.980 --> 00:35.140
♪ Contemplate the vastness
of Heaven and Earth ♪

00:35.140 --> 00:40.910
♪ Could it be that both of us
are filled with desolation? ♪

00:41.790 --> 00:45.630
♪ As flowers bloom and wither ♪

00:45.630 --> 00:51.400
♪ May we lead such a life ♪

00:52.350 --> 00:56.520
♪ Contemplate the vastness
of Heaven and Earth ♪

00:56.520 --> 01:01.900
♪ Turning back, you and I ♪

01:05.740 --> 01:07.270
♪ Seize the current moment ♪

01:07.270 --> 01:10.920
♪ The sky is painted
with a gentle pallet of pastel colors ♪

01:10.920 --> 01:15.920
♪ Let's walk together ♪

01:16.360 --> 01:17.970
♪ Even if ♪

01:17.970 --> 01:21.660
♪ The snow in front of us ♪

01:21.680 --> 01:23.170
♪ Will dye our hair white ♪

01:23.170 --> 01:27.210
♪ In an instant ♪

01:27.210 --> 01:28.310
[Joy of Life Season 2]

01:28.310 --> 01:30.780
[Adapted from Mao Ni's Joy of Life
on Yuewen Group's Qidian platform]

01:30.780 --> 01:34.300
[Episode 12]

01:34.879 --> 01:35.930
It wasn't fake.

01:35.950 --> 01:37.739
I already asked the imperial physician.

01:37.759 --> 01:39.739
Judging from his condition,
it's an internal injury.

01:39.759 --> 01:41.320
No one can fake that.

01:45.759 --> 01:47.240
So, he fought someone?

01:47.800 --> 01:49.320
Who did it?

01:49.640 --> 01:51.160
We have no info at all.

01:51.560 --> 01:54.360
Who would attack Fan Xian
at such a time?

01:54.959 --> 01:56.440
Could it be himself?

01:57.360 --> 01:59.780
Your Highness, such internal injury

01:59.800 --> 02:01.420
might cause him to lose all his skills.

02:01.440 --> 02:03.019
Even if he had been
trying to hurt himself,

02:03.039 --> 02:05.039
he wouldn't have needed
to resort to that.

02:05.080 --> 02:07.080
If so, this is strange.

02:07.640 --> 02:08.720
Who...

02:09.519 --> 02:11.320
Who inflicted the injury on him?

02:12.920 --> 02:14.539
Deliver this to Father.

02:14.559 --> 02:15.799
What is this?

02:15.880 --> 02:18.079
Isn't it obvious? It's the antidote.

02:18.600 --> 02:20.079
I almost forgot about it!

02:20.519 --> 02:21.539
One pill is enough.

02:21.559 --> 02:22.720
Understood.

02:27.439 --> 02:28.519
Mr. Fan!

02:33.320 --> 02:34.799
It's fine.

02:35.040 --> 02:37.039
Just let me rest for a while.

02:37.200 --> 02:38.180
Mr. Fan,

02:38.200 --> 02:39.740
your qi flow has been out of control

02:39.760 --> 02:42.119
ever since you returned to the Capital.

02:42.119 --> 02:44.160
This won't do.

02:44.399 --> 02:45.860
You should seek some help.

02:45.880 --> 02:47.160
From who?

02:47.519 --> 02:50.359
I don't even know who's
practicing the same skill as me.

02:53.080 --> 02:55.419
You shouldn't fight again.

02:55.439 --> 02:56.759
Don't worry about that.

02:57.119 --> 02:58.919
I'm not a troublemaker.

03:02.160 --> 03:03.799
Is there something you want to say?

03:04.839 --> 03:06.239
Nothing.

03:06.320 --> 03:07.720
You're right.

03:09.320 --> 03:12.020
Have Deng Ziyue
and the rest spread the news?

03:12.040 --> 03:13.239
You're still worried about that?

03:13.239 --> 03:15.720
That's just a trivial issue.

03:25.600 --> 03:27.079
Miss Ye is here.

03:28.480 --> 03:29.680
Ye Ling'er?

03:30.320 --> 03:31.600
Is Wan'er here, then?

03:34.360 --> 03:35.600
Are you sick for real?

03:37.320 --> 03:37.860
No.

03:37.880 --> 03:39.120
I was just faking it.

03:40.320 --> 03:42.099
I'll relay the news to Wan'er, then.

03:42.119 --> 03:43.819
Did she have a message for me?

03:43.839 --> 03:44.770
You're not sick.

03:44.790 --> 03:46.480
I'm not relaying the message to you.

03:47.200 --> 03:48.900
If so, please tell her

03:48.920 --> 03:50.239
that I miss her very much.

03:51.200 --> 03:52.479
Got it.

03:58.160 --> 03:59.479
Mr. Fan, you...

04:00.360 --> 04:01.880
You're quite genuine, huh?

04:01.880 --> 04:03.880
You should hurry and sit down.

04:10.519 --> 04:11.720
Mr. Fan,

04:12.040 --> 04:14.819
the scandal between Yuan Meng
and Prince Jing

04:14.839 --> 04:17.460
was spread to the public.

04:17.480 --> 04:20.219
And, judging from the result,
it seemed like

04:20.239 --> 04:23.839
the people trust you more.

04:24.280 --> 04:26.020
Why are you still sighing, then?

04:26.040 --> 04:27.560
Why do you look so gloomy?

04:29.360 --> 04:31.639
It's because rumors have been spreading
within the Six Ministries.

04:31.639 --> 04:33.099
It was terrible.

04:33.119 --> 04:36.440
They said Mr. Fan
abused his power for personal gain.

04:37.879 --> 04:39.399
What does that mean?

04:41.660 --> 04:44.539
Regarding the Imperial Procuratorate's
investigation of corrupt officials,

04:44.559 --> 04:47.659
they said that Mr. Fan
was the mastermind behind it.

04:47.679 --> 04:50.280
As for the proof, they said the corrupt officials
who were investigated

04:50.280 --> 04:52.440
all belonged
to the Second Prince's faction.

04:53.559 --> 04:55.820
Therefore, Fan Xian's so-called
corruption abolishment

04:55.840 --> 04:57.700
is but an excuse for him
to win influence.

04:57.720 --> 04:59.299
Serving justice is just a ruse.

04:59.319 --> 05:01.380
Competing against Li Chengze
is my true motive.

05:01.400 --> 05:03.059
Mr. Fan, have you
heard about it as well?

05:03.079 --> 05:04.340
I made an educated guess

05:04.360 --> 05:05.639
based on what you said.

05:06.600 --> 05:08.260
If so, what's wrong with the rumor?

05:08.280 --> 05:11.159
Isn't it the same
for all officials in the court?

05:13.119 --> 05:14.839
But I can't do the same.

05:15.920 --> 05:17.859
I'm backed by the Imperial Inspectorate.

05:17.879 --> 05:19.440
If I can use justice as an excuse

05:19.520 --> 05:21.000
for the first time,

05:21.160 --> 05:22.419
that means I can use it again.

05:22.439 --> 05:25.300
Since I'm using this method
to deal with Li Chengze,

05:25.320 --> 05:26.800
I can use the same method

05:27.199 --> 05:28.900
to deal with all officials
in the Capital

05:28.920 --> 05:31.000
in the future.

05:31.840 --> 05:33.199
Here, have some water.

05:35.559 --> 05:36.600
By then,

05:36.600 --> 05:38.739
everyone will feel insecure
about their positions.

05:38.759 --> 05:41.279
And, Mr. Fan, you'll become
their public enemy.

05:41.920 --> 05:43.880
There's no way for me to explain myself.

05:47.119 --> 05:50.360
Unless I can make them
understand that I'm not that devious.

05:50.660 --> 05:52.860
I have to make them feel
that I'm young and reckless.

05:55.040 --> 05:58.120
That's an excellent idea.

05:58.520 --> 06:00.959
Mr. Fan, what should we do?

06:02.999 --> 06:04.900
Mr. Fan, where are you going?

06:04.920 --> 06:06.159
I'm going to see Wan'er.

06:09.239 --> 06:09.900
Mr. Fan!

06:09.920 --> 06:11.520
This is inappropriate of you!

06:11.520 --> 06:13.670
Don't forget you revealed to the public
that you're sick right now.

06:13.679 --> 06:15.520
I never denied it.
Do you have my medicine, then?

06:15.520 --> 06:16.600
But you're sick.

06:16.600 --> 06:18.160
How could you just loiter around?

06:18.160 --> 06:19.260
That's my fiancee.

06:19.280 --> 06:20.639
Doesn't that make it more ridiculous?

06:20.639 --> 06:23.380
I'm trying to make the officials
think that I'm ridiculous.

06:23.400 --> 06:24.880
What's wrong with that?

06:25.559 --> 06:26.199
Excellent idea.

06:26.199 --> 06:27.500
Deng, return to the First Division.

06:27.520 --> 06:29.400
Continue to spread the news
of Yuan Meng and Prince Jing.

06:29.400 --> 06:31.060
They wish to gain influence
within the officialdom.

06:31.060 --> 06:32.299
I wish to win the people's hearts.

06:32.319 --> 06:33.399
Yes, Mr. Fan.

06:34.999 --> 06:38.199
Mr. Fan, you have to use this.

06:38.480 --> 06:40.650
You're gravely ill now.

06:40.670 --> 06:42.480
The relationship
between Yuan Meng and Prince Jing

06:42.480 --> 06:44.560
has been spreading like wildfire.

06:47.360 --> 06:49.800
Mr. Fan is the inspector
of the Imperial Inspectorate.

06:49.800 --> 06:52.519
It's easy for him
to spread news and rumors.

06:53.080 --> 06:55.480
Prince Jing has always been
close to you, Your Highness.

06:55.520 --> 06:56.870
People are speculating

06:56.890 --> 06:58.850
that there's a mastermind
behind Baoyue Pleasure House.

06:58.870 --> 07:00.120
That doesn't matter.

07:00.319 --> 07:01.839
It's just a rumor.

07:01.920 --> 07:04.619
Regarding that, I think
great minds think alike.

07:04.639 --> 07:05.820
He spread rumors, huh?

07:05.840 --> 07:07.399
I did the same too.

07:07.720 --> 07:09.950
Your Highness, you've already
spread rumors as well?

07:10.230 --> 07:12.059
Why haven't I heard of it
from the people?

07:12.079 --> 07:13.839
We can't win against the people.

07:13.879 --> 07:14.859
You see,

07:14.879 --> 07:16.120
the people hate corrupt officials.

07:16.120 --> 07:18.219
Fan Xian gained the upper hand
by targeting them first.

07:18.239 --> 07:19.839
As for the rumors I spread,

07:19.910 --> 07:21.759
they're only spread to the officialdom.

07:23.079 --> 07:24.199
Your Highness,

07:24.400 --> 07:27.680
we don't have many
good officials in the Capital.

07:28.119 --> 07:30.560
They might not care
about other people's lives.

07:30.720 --> 07:33.320
But they care about their own lives.

07:33.840 --> 07:35.140
I can't just stay home all the time.

07:35.160 --> 07:36.380
I'll visit my relatives.

07:36.400 --> 07:38.010
You're visiting your relatives?

07:38.199 --> 07:39.560
At this timing?

07:41.199 --> 07:42.519
You see,

07:42.879 --> 07:44.599
I have an important quality.

07:44.960 --> 07:47.010
It's called kicking someone
while they're down.

07:59.325 --> 08:01.345
[Lin Wan'er's Residence,
Imperial Courtyard]

08:32.880 --> 08:33.780
What are you doing here?

08:33.800 --> 08:35.320
I'm sharpening my cleaver.

08:35.719 --> 08:36.900
What are you doing here?

08:36.920 --> 08:38.550
Weren't you pretending to be sick?

08:38.599 --> 08:39.719
Is Wan'er around?

08:39.990 --> 08:41.239
She's inside her room.

08:42.319 --> 08:43.260
By the way,

08:43.280 --> 08:44.339
I have a question.

08:44.359 --> 08:46.659
Why is the courtyard's gate open?

08:46.679 --> 08:48.020
There are no guards at all.

08:48.040 --> 08:50.479
All of them are inside.
They're there to deter assassins.

08:50.959 --> 08:52.120
Is someone trying to harm Wan'er?

08:52.120 --> 08:53.140
It's not Wan'er.

08:53.160 --> 08:54.560
Who else can it be, then?

09:12.040 --> 09:16.440
Cousin Chengze, must we
have a meal together?

09:18.400 --> 09:20.900
Cousin Chengze? Call me Chengze.

09:20.920 --> 09:23.440
We're a family, you know? Don't make it
sound like we're strangers.

09:23.880 --> 09:25.479
Look at the time.

09:25.800 --> 09:27.500
I'm here to visit you
and have a meal with you.

09:27.520 --> 09:29.160
Why are you trying to chase me away?

09:29.400 --> 09:31.999
Is your life more important?
Or is the meal more important?

09:34.960 --> 09:36.280
Both are important.

09:37.920 --> 09:39.419
Li Chengze is here?

09:39.439 --> 09:41.220
Someone is out to kill him?

09:41.240 --> 09:42.479
Who?

09:45.359 --> 09:46.439
Me.

09:47.559 --> 09:49.539
Don't obstruct me! I'll kill him!

09:49.559 --> 09:51.440
- I'll kill him!
- Li Chengze, run!

09:56.240 --> 09:58.160
You want to kill Li Chengze?

09:58.200 --> 10:00.070
Why do you think
I'm sharpening my cleaver?

10:00.920 --> 10:02.250
He's the prince.

10:02.270 --> 10:04.320
Have you ever considered
the consequences?

10:06.400 --> 10:07.520
I have.

10:07.760 --> 10:10.160
I'll die, no matter what I do anyway.

10:10.600 --> 10:12.480
If so, why are you
still trying to kill him?

10:12.599 --> 10:14.240
His Majesty granted us a marriage.

10:14.400 --> 10:15.539
I'm unhappy with it.

10:15.559 --> 10:17.059
I'm upset about it too.

10:17.079 --> 10:18.100
To be honest,

10:18.120 --> 10:19.760
of all the noble ladies in the Capital,

10:19.760 --> 10:22.300
Heroine Ye is the worst match for me.

10:22.320 --> 10:23.550
She's not willing to get married to you.

10:23.550 --> 10:24.900
You're not willing to marry her either.

10:24.920 --> 10:26.220
That makes things much easier.

10:26.240 --> 10:28.179
Just cancel the marriage, then.

10:28.199 --> 10:29.660
Is our will even important?

10:29.680 --> 10:30.920
His Majesty granted us this marriage.

10:30.920 --> 10:32.370
His orders are absolute.

10:32.390 --> 10:33.780
Wan'er, let me ask you something.

10:33.800 --> 10:36.400
What if you and Fan Xian
hated each other

10:36.400 --> 10:37.699
during your first encounter?

10:37.719 --> 10:40.440
Would it be any different now?

10:44.599 --> 10:47.079
No, nothing would change.

10:47.270 --> 10:48.800
You guys are a match made in heaven.

10:48.820 --> 10:51.150
It's because His Majesty
granted the marriage to you two.

10:51.719 --> 10:54.040
Actually, our marriage

10:54.160 --> 10:55.719
has nothing to do with us.

10:56.120 --> 10:57.200
Wan'er,

10:58.120 --> 10:59.800
you're just lucky.

11:07.959 --> 11:08.939
What are you doing?

11:08.959 --> 11:10.419
His neck isn't as tough as this pillar.

11:10.439 --> 11:12.400
This cleaver is sharp enough to kill.

11:12.559 --> 11:14.220
You don't dare to kill him at all.

11:14.240 --> 11:15.959
You're just trying
to express your stand here.

11:15.959 --> 11:17.860
You're telling everyone
that you're dissatisfied.

11:17.880 --> 11:20.400
You wish to scare him away with this.

11:20.559 --> 11:22.280
You're just escaping from reality.

11:30.439 --> 11:31.640
That's right!

11:32.079 --> 11:33.959
I dare not kill him.

11:35.319 --> 11:37.719
I don't even dare
to escape from the Capital.

11:38.290 --> 11:40.220
It's because
I'll go against imperial order

11:40.240 --> 11:41.320
if I leave the Capital.

11:41.340 --> 11:43.460
The Ye family can't deal
with the consequences.

11:43.839 --> 11:45.740
That's why I can only
escape from reality.

11:45.760 --> 11:47.400
You don't dare to kill him, huh?

11:47.439 --> 11:48.959
But I can help you out.

11:50.319 --> 11:51.179
What is this?

11:51.199 --> 11:52.100
Potent poison.

11:52.120 --> 11:54.459
His orifices will bleed
and he'll die in half a day.

11:54.479 --> 11:55.420
And after that,

11:55.440 --> 11:57.260
no one will expect us
to plot for his death together.

11:57.280 --> 11:58.500
Have you lost your mind?

11:58.520 --> 11:59.780
I thought you hated the engagement.

11:59.800 --> 12:01.500
Even so, I can't just
kill someone because of it.

12:01.520 --> 12:02.699
How deep is the feud between you two?

12:02.719 --> 12:04.959
Why are you trying
to kill him with poison?

12:12.199 --> 12:13.440
You're right.

12:13.880 --> 12:15.079
I was wrong.

12:15.110 --> 12:16.720
I shouldn't kill him with poison.

12:17.000 --> 12:18.879
See you. I'll check things out inside.

12:19.390 --> 12:20.479
What about you?

12:21.679 --> 12:22.759
Forget it.

12:23.599 --> 12:24.839
I'll go inside too.

12:25.510 --> 12:27.370
There's no place for me
to escape to anyway.

12:27.390 --> 12:28.920
I have to face it eventually.

12:29.359 --> 12:30.699
I have to face it eventually.

12:30.719 --> 12:32.599
Reality is a cruel mistress indeed.

12:33.240 --> 12:35.199
However, there's nowhere to escape.

12:36.200 --> 12:38.520
Cousin Chengze, sounds like
you're implying something.

12:38.559 --> 12:40.479
Why don't you get straight to the point?

12:46.800 --> 12:48.720
Initially, I wanted
to hide this from you.

12:49.000 --> 12:50.420
But when I think about it...

12:50.440 --> 12:53.120
The Fan family and Baoyue Pleasure House
is quite a huge deal,

12:53.959 --> 12:55.719
so you should've heard of it by now.

12:56.040 --> 12:57.120
Of course.

12:58.880 --> 13:01.520
I'm here to explain things
on Fan Xian's behalf.

13:02.079 --> 13:04.860
Baoyue Pleasure House
was Fan Sizhe's idea.

13:04.880 --> 13:06.239
It's none of his business.

13:06.800 --> 13:08.390
You shouldn't blame him for it.

13:09.640 --> 13:11.280
I see.

13:11.319 --> 13:13.160
I can understand why he allowed

13:13.160 --> 13:14.140
Fan Sizhe to escape.

13:14.160 --> 13:16.199
After all, they're brothers.

13:16.280 --> 13:19.640
However, their enterprise
is cruel indeed.

13:19.640 --> 13:21.640
A courtesan was beaten to death

13:22.240 --> 13:23.719
just two days ago.

13:24.000 --> 13:26.579
They should show respect for one's life.

13:26.599 --> 13:28.680
When you're free,
you should persuade them

13:28.700 --> 13:29.710
to close down the enterprise

13:29.719 --> 13:32.119
if possible.

13:36.280 --> 13:37.360
By the way,

13:38.160 --> 13:38.959
speaking of which,

13:38.959 --> 13:41.520
Fan Xian has returned
to the Capital for some time now.

13:41.839 --> 13:43.520
Has he ever visited you?

13:59.800 --> 14:01.440
Sorry about that.

14:01.599 --> 14:03.160
My hand slipped.

14:19.520 --> 14:21.719
This is too fast!

14:23.040 --> 14:24.520
I'm here!

14:24.920 --> 14:27.359
Hey, we overshot!

14:29.240 --> 14:30.900
You call that fast?

14:30.920 --> 14:32.479
It's slower than a tortoise.

14:33.199 --> 14:34.800
How is she losing control?

14:35.479 --> 14:36.980
What are you looking at?

14:37.000 --> 14:38.400
I'm talking to you.

14:39.679 --> 14:41.140
You'd better listen closely.

14:41.160 --> 14:42.980
You shouldn't learn from it.

14:43.000 --> 14:45.179
Understood? Learn to be good.

14:45.199 --> 14:47.599
If so, you'll get your hay.

14:49.439 --> 14:50.519
Your Highness.

14:51.599 --> 14:52.939
You serve Fan Xian, don't you?

14:52.959 --> 14:54.060
That's right. That's me.

14:54.080 --> 14:56.190
[Zhixiang Court]
Your Highness, you have an excellent memory.

14:56.199 --> 14:57.479
You still remember me.

15:04.280 --> 15:07.680
You were the one who killed
my warhorse outside the city.

15:07.959 --> 15:10.579
That wasn't me. That was Gao Da.

15:10.599 --> 15:11.780
He was standing beside me.

15:11.800 --> 15:12.900
You two are on the same side.

15:12.920 --> 15:15.059
Your Highness,
please don't misunderstand me.

15:15.079 --> 15:17.100
I'm gentle and mild,

15:17.120 --> 15:18.719
while Gao Da has a short temper.

15:18.959 --> 15:20.320
What's your name again?

15:21.079 --> 15:23.040
I am...

15:23.520 --> 15:25.239
Deng Ziyue.

15:25.400 --> 15:26.800
Deng Ziyue?

15:27.090 --> 15:28.380
Was that your name before this?

15:28.400 --> 15:29.520
Indeed.

15:29.719 --> 15:30.299
I

15:30.319 --> 15:32.479
stay true to my name.

15:34.320 --> 15:35.440
Where is she?

15:35.800 --> 15:37.340
Has she entered the residence?

15:37.920 --> 15:39.079
Who do you mean?

15:40.880 --> 15:43.839
Do you mean
Crown Princess of Northern Qi?

15:44.040 --> 15:46.100
She passed by just now.

15:46.120 --> 15:47.280
She left?

15:47.479 --> 15:48.090
Where did she go?

15:48.110 --> 15:49.280
She went over there.

15:50.280 --> 15:51.500
Why didn't you stop her?

15:51.520 --> 15:53.419
I dare not stop a princess.

15:53.439 --> 15:54.980
She's here to see Wan'er.

15:55.000 --> 15:57.079
She didn't tell me that just now.

15:58.880 --> 16:00.239
I'll go and find her.

16:06.679 --> 16:07.920
Deng Ziyue,

16:08.199 --> 16:09.680
I'll remember you now.

16:10.240 --> 16:11.819
Your Highness, please forgive me.

16:11.839 --> 16:13.900
I'm terrified!

16:13.920 --> 16:16.920
I, Deng Ziyue,
humbly beg for your forgiveness!

16:50.640 --> 16:52.479
Why have you lost so much weight?

16:53.319 --> 16:54.780
Did you suffer in Northern Qi?

16:54.800 --> 16:55.919
No.

16:56.199 --> 16:58.239
Why would I let myself suffer?

16:58.820 --> 17:00.790
People revered me
when I was in Northern Qi.

17:01.120 --> 17:03.719
Besides, I look more spirited
after losing weight.

17:04.800 --> 17:06.079
Don't do that.

17:07.399 --> 17:09.040
Don't jeopardize your health.

17:11.119 --> 17:12.280
Sorry.

17:14.040 --> 17:15.359
I've made you worried

17:16.520 --> 17:17.960
all this while.

17:40.399 --> 17:41.000
Initially,

17:41.000 --> 17:43.119
I was supposed to see you
right after coming back.

17:43.119 --> 17:45.090
But His Majesty summoned me.

17:45.110 --> 17:46.559
After that, I had
plenty of trivial affairs

17:46.559 --> 17:47.940
and troubles to resolve.

17:47.960 --> 17:49.579
I could only visit you now.

17:49.599 --> 17:50.839
It's my fault.

17:52.359 --> 17:54.020
But you shouldn't be here today.

17:54.040 --> 17:55.760
Weren't you sick?

17:59.200 --> 18:01.240
I'm fine. I was pretending to be sick.

18:02.680 --> 18:03.760
It was fake?

18:04.839 --> 18:05.980
What about your father, then?

18:06.000 --> 18:06.820
It's the same.

18:06.840 --> 18:08.099
Is he pretending to be sick as well?

18:08.119 --> 18:09.320
It runs in the family.

18:09.839 --> 18:11.339
Don't act tough, okay?

18:11.359 --> 18:12.520
I promise you I won't.

18:12.670 --> 18:15.930
Your entire family is pretending to be sick?
Does this count as deceiving the ruler?

18:16.150 --> 18:17.580
Now, I have to keep your secret for you.

18:17.600 --> 18:19.000
Your Highness,
you shouldn't speak too much.

18:19.000 --> 18:20.240
If not, I think my hand will slip again.

18:20.240 --> 18:21.420
You and your temper.

18:21.440 --> 18:22.700
You can ask Wan'er.

18:22.720 --> 18:25.359
I came here to speak up for you.

18:28.800 --> 18:31.919
If you think he's bothering you,
I'll send him away.

18:36.000 --> 18:36.890
You're so heartless.

18:36.910 --> 18:38.040
No need for that.

18:39.159 --> 18:41.520
There are some things
we should clarify in person.

18:49.480 --> 18:51.960
The lady who died terribly
outside Baoyue Pleasure House,

18:53.159 --> 18:54.480
her surname was Jin.

18:55.159 --> 18:56.359
Did you know that?

18:57.240 --> 18:58.679
Was I supposed to know that?

19:00.320 --> 19:02.480
Why does it sound like
you two are pretty close?

19:02.919 --> 19:06.379
Her father died outside
Baoyue Pleasure House as well.

19:06.399 --> 19:07.639
What a coincidence.

19:08.280 --> 19:09.520
How did he die?

19:09.680 --> 19:11.060
How did he die?

19:11.080 --> 19:13.000
They forced his daughter
to be a courtesan,

19:13.040 --> 19:14.800
and that caused his family to shatter.

19:15.119 --> 19:18.200
If so, you should persuade Fan Sizhe

19:19.159 --> 19:20.760
to turn himself in.

19:23.280 --> 19:24.720
Two lives were lost.

19:25.800 --> 19:27.720
Don't you have anything
to say about that?

19:33.559 --> 19:34.639
What a shame.

19:35.280 --> 19:36.360
Is that all?

19:36.440 --> 19:37.679
What else should I say?

19:40.800 --> 19:42.260
The Capital is full of people.

19:42.280 --> 19:43.720
People die every day.

19:43.760 --> 19:45.800
How could I predict one's death?

19:45.910 --> 19:48.110
What else can I say
besides lamenting their deaths?

19:55.960 --> 19:57.200
To be honest,

19:58.119 --> 20:01.520
I'm truly impressed by your demeanor.

20:03.159 --> 20:05.919
Life is unpredictable.

20:07.760 --> 20:09.119
We should take it easy.

20:09.319 --> 20:10.720
Excellent quote.

20:11.280 --> 20:12.560
I'll remember that.

20:29.599 --> 20:32.200
To all the people
who suffered wrongful deaths.

20:46.800 --> 20:48.520
What should we do when it's hungry?

20:48.760 --> 20:50.439
It'll only take a while. It'll be fine.

21:03.159 --> 21:04.919
We have hay here. It won't starve.

21:13.040 --> 21:14.500
We're here to see Princess Lin

21:14.520 --> 21:16.180
without notifying her in advance.

21:16.200 --> 21:18.960
Aren't we being rude here?

21:19.040 --> 21:21.639
It's fine.
Wan'er is just like my sister.

21:25.000 --> 21:26.080
What's wrong?

21:27.200 --> 21:28.399
Your hair is messy.

21:39.680 --> 21:40.879
Do I look better now?

21:47.430 --> 21:48.680
You look better now.

21:55.879 --> 21:56.890
Sorry about that.

21:56.910 --> 21:58.159
I'm used to tidying my soldiers' armor

21:58.159 --> 22:00.040
and get-up in the military camp.

22:02.000 --> 22:03.320
I was rude.

22:03.720 --> 22:04.540
Sorry about that.

22:04.560 --> 22:06.000
I'll apologize for that.

22:09.639 --> 22:12.119
I accept your apology.

22:12.520 --> 22:15.119
Don't do it again.

22:20.559 --> 22:22.159
What are you doing?

22:22.480 --> 22:25.240
Why don't I swear a vow with my blood?

22:29.040 --> 22:30.879
That's what we do in Northern Qi.

22:39.000 --> 22:41.560
Am I too brutish?

22:42.870 --> 22:44.379
I've been in the border army
for many years.

22:44.399 --> 22:45.200
There are some habits

22:45.200 --> 22:46.890
that I can't change out of the blue.

22:53.280 --> 22:56.639
It's good that he's genuine.

22:59.870 --> 23:01.160
That's the wrong way.

23:01.760 --> 23:02.840
Over here.

23:33.480 --> 23:34.200
When I was young,

23:34.200 --> 23:35.619
I often came here to sponge off them.

23:35.639 --> 23:36.899
The taste is still the same.

23:36.919 --> 23:38.000
Is that so?

23:40.000 --> 23:41.760
If so, Cousin Chengru,
you should eat up.

23:46.720 --> 23:49.919
I thought the atmosphere
was off when I came inside.

23:51.480 --> 23:52.159
I even saw...

23:52.159 --> 23:53.870
Nothing's off about the atmosphere.

23:54.960 --> 23:57.960
But you two, well...

23:59.240 --> 24:00.639
I owe him a horse.

24:00.800 --> 24:01.899
What horse?

24:01.919 --> 24:04.480
We went to the marketplace
and bought a horse.

24:04.710 --> 24:07.020
The royal family of Northern Qi
is straightforward and upright.

24:07.040 --> 24:08.560
We never owe anyone any debts.

24:09.399 --> 24:10.760
You bought a horse?

24:11.840 --> 24:13.220
I tried riding the horse just now.

24:13.240 --> 24:14.539
The warhorses of the Qing State

24:14.559 --> 24:16.159
do gallop quickly.

24:19.079 --> 24:21.640
You bought a warhorse
in the marketplace here?

24:21.660 --> 24:22.930
She was exhausted from all the shopping.

24:22.930 --> 24:24.350
Her Highness wanted
to make your acquaintance.

24:24.350 --> 24:25.790
That's why I brought her here.

24:27.480 --> 24:28.760
Your Highness, please.

24:31.320 --> 24:33.059
What did you guys chat about just now?

24:33.079 --> 24:34.720
I can sense a killing intent.

24:35.350 --> 24:36.319
Chengru, you must be joking.

24:36.319 --> 24:37.720
It was just a casual chat.

24:37.800 --> 24:39.420
I spent a long time
with the border army.

24:39.440 --> 24:41.700
I know a killing intent when I see one.

24:41.720 --> 24:42.399
You know me.

24:42.399 --> 24:45.859
I always give in whenever I can.

24:45.879 --> 24:47.040
Really?

24:50.480 --> 24:51.760
Here's a toast to you.

24:53.720 --> 24:54.780
To me?

24:54.800 --> 24:55.930
It's my apology.

24:55.950 --> 24:57.700
I shouldn't have pointed
my cleaver at you.

24:57.720 --> 24:58.800
It's fine.

24:58.919 --> 25:00.960
At least it's better
than you throwing it at me.

25:06.200 --> 25:07.839
Do you have someone you like?

25:08.879 --> 25:10.110
I beg your pardon?

25:10.800 --> 25:13.819
The kind of person you've liked so much
that you wish to marry her

25:13.839 --> 25:15.159
since childhood.

25:15.200 --> 25:16.280
No.

25:16.319 --> 25:17.399
Neither do I.

25:18.280 --> 25:19.330
That's good.

25:19.350 --> 25:20.720
At least we won't need to suffer as much

25:20.720 --> 25:22.520
when we get married in the future.

25:25.760 --> 25:26.840
What's wrong?

25:27.960 --> 25:29.370
I've been staring at you just now.

25:29.390 --> 25:30.720
You were staring at me?

25:30.879 --> 25:32.420
I wish to see your face closely.

25:32.440 --> 25:34.159
I never observed it before.

25:34.280 --> 25:35.379
Are you drunk?

25:35.399 --> 25:36.859
I did drink,

25:36.879 --> 25:38.200
but I'm sober.

25:38.720 --> 25:39.800
Your Highness,

25:40.240 --> 25:42.000
I've been staring at you for some time.

25:42.240 --> 25:43.800
You're very unique.

25:45.879 --> 25:47.260
However, there's no way
I'll fall for you.

25:47.280 --> 25:48.130
So?

25:48.150 --> 25:49.500
What about your opinion of me?

25:49.520 --> 25:51.070
It's about the same as yours.

25:52.800 --> 25:54.639
If so, we should work together

25:54.760 --> 25:56.520
and try to cancel the engagement.

25:59.119 --> 26:00.180
How?

26:00.200 --> 26:01.839
Didn't you say you would give in
whenever you could?

26:01.840 --> 26:03.130
This is a different matter.

26:03.150 --> 26:04.819
His Majesty granted this marriage to us.

26:04.839 --> 26:06.680
But there are no feelings between us.

26:06.680 --> 26:07.859
Is that even important?

26:07.879 --> 26:09.460
Isn't it important?

26:09.480 --> 26:11.090
A marriage will affect
the rest of our lives.

26:11.110 --> 26:12.480
Do you believe in fate?

26:13.559 --> 26:15.960
Don't tell me you're going to say
that our engagement

26:16.359 --> 26:17.899
was determined by fate?

26:17.919 --> 26:19.520
In life,

26:19.760 --> 26:21.320
we're affected by fate.

26:21.800 --> 26:23.420
To you and me,

26:23.440 --> 26:25.260
His Majesty's edict represents our fate.

26:25.280 --> 26:26.839
Since we can't resist it,

26:27.440 --> 26:28.700
we can only accept it.

26:28.720 --> 26:30.819
Can't we think of any other solutions?

26:30.839 --> 26:32.000
You can ask the rest of them, then.

26:32.000 --> 26:33.240
All of them
are in the same situation as us.

26:33.240 --> 26:34.980
Ask them whether or not
they wanted to escape from it.

26:34.980 --> 26:36.399
I thought of that long ago.

26:36.560 --> 26:38.339
On my way back to the Capital
from the border areas,

26:38.359 --> 26:40.700
I reserved excellent horses
at the courier stations I passed by.

26:40.720 --> 26:42.299
You reserved horses? But why?

26:42.319 --> 26:43.599
I thought to myself

26:44.200 --> 26:46.200
that I should meet the princess somehow.

26:46.839 --> 26:48.539
If she were better than I expected,

26:48.559 --> 26:50.060
I'd have nothing to say.

26:50.080 --> 26:51.960
What if I didn't meet your expectations?

26:52.430 --> 26:54.359
I'd rush out of the Capital
and use the horses I reserved,

26:54.359 --> 26:56.260
and I'd reach the border areas
in just a few days.

26:56.280 --> 26:58.500
When do you plan to escape
from the Capital?

26:58.520 --> 26:59.460
What's your plan?

26:59.480 --> 27:01.280
Can I plan it together with you?

27:09.680 --> 27:12.159
You want to help me plan for my escape?

27:12.520 --> 27:15.500
I've always wanted to run away
from the palace since I was young.

27:15.520 --> 27:17.020
However, it was just a dream.

27:17.040 --> 27:19.339
But now, I've encountered
someone who can make it come true.

27:19.359 --> 27:20.859
I have plenty of ideas.

27:20.879 --> 27:22.399
Maybe I can help you out.

27:23.430 --> 27:24.800
It's unnecessary for now.

27:26.520 --> 27:27.760
But why?

27:29.720 --> 27:31.119
Now, it looks like

27:32.150 --> 27:33.520
I don't have to run away.

27:39.720 --> 27:41.599
If so, you must tell me

27:41.879 --> 27:43.280
if you wish to run away.

27:43.359 --> 27:45.760
Okay. I promise you
that you'll be the first person to know.

27:48.520 --> 27:49.980
You may consider escaping

27:50.000 --> 27:50.890
to the border areas

27:50.910 --> 27:52.299
if you're unhappy with the engagement.

27:52.319 --> 27:53.200
The view there is excellent,

27:53.200 --> 27:54.539
and you can live there
without restraints.

27:54.559 --> 27:55.839
I cannot run away.

27:56.079 --> 27:57.780
My entire family lives in the Capital.

27:57.800 --> 27:59.899
You can bring your entire family
with you if you want.

27:59.919 --> 28:01.240
That's not possible.

28:01.510 --> 28:03.610
The Ye family received
His Majesty's grace for generations.

28:03.630 --> 28:05.280
All of us have military positions.

28:05.720 --> 28:07.599
How can we escape to the border areas?

28:08.000 --> 28:09.740
If we do, it'll sound like a rebellion.

28:09.760 --> 28:11.460
You can try escaping to Danzhou.

28:11.480 --> 28:12.600
When I first came to the Capital,

28:12.600 --> 28:14.040
I thought of escaping
to Danzhou every day.

28:14.040 --> 28:15.439
You wanted to escape too?

28:16.040 --> 28:17.820
I would've escaped

28:17.840 --> 28:19.359
if I hadn't encountered Wan'er.

28:19.480 --> 28:21.310
You dare to resist an imperial order

28:21.440 --> 28:22.859
because of a marriage?

28:22.879 --> 28:25.520
The rest of my life is more important
than the imperial order.

28:25.879 --> 28:26.680
I forgot.

28:26.700 --> 28:27.879
I don't dare to say the same for others,

28:27.879 --> 28:29.980
but Mr. Fan is a free spirit.

28:30.000 --> 28:31.299
Forget about the past.

28:31.319 --> 28:32.539
Let's talk about the present.

28:32.559 --> 28:34.630
If you truly wish to leave,
you can even escape to Northern Qi.

28:34.639 --> 28:37.320
After all, you have plenty of friends.

28:37.839 --> 28:40.379
Actually, the rumors
of Mr. Fan in Northern Qi

28:40.399 --> 28:42.240
were fake.

28:44.359 --> 28:46.679
Especially the one about him
being a womanizer.

28:48.919 --> 28:49.999
Your Highness,

28:50.319 --> 28:52.890
no one has mentioned that before.

28:52.910 --> 28:54.899
But there are plenty of rumors
regarding you.

28:54.919 --> 28:57.070
Everyone knows
about your scandal with Duoduo.

28:57.399 --> 28:58.559
The entire world

28:58.559 --> 28:59.819
thought

28:59.839 --> 29:02.299
that you and the Holy Maiden,
Haitang Duoduo,

29:02.319 --> 29:03.440
understood each other,

29:03.440 --> 29:04.710
had a deep affection for each other,

29:04.710 --> 29:06.280
and regretted that you two
hadn't met each other earlier.

29:06.280 --> 29:06.899
Your Highness...

29:06.919 --> 29:09.119
You don't need to use
all those metaphors.

29:09.399 --> 29:12.119
Your Highness, I assume
you've heard of these rumors before.

29:16.200 --> 29:17.760
I've heard of them long ago.

29:18.440 --> 29:20.940
I came here to visit you today

29:20.960 --> 29:22.220
so that I could dispel the rumors.

29:22.240 --> 29:25.560
There's nothing
between Mr. Fan and Duoduo.

29:27.159 --> 29:28.379
Are the rumors false, then?

29:28.399 --> 29:29.500
I wouldn't say that.

29:29.520 --> 29:31.399
Those events did happen, after all.

29:33.480 --> 29:34.379
They did happen, huh?

29:34.399 --> 29:35.420
Yes.

29:35.440 --> 29:37.290
Expressing his feelings in the court,

29:37.290 --> 29:39.040
and dancing together
during the birthday banquet,

29:39.040 --> 29:40.440
those events did happen.

29:40.720 --> 29:42.159
They did happen, huh?

29:44.760 --> 29:47.059
However, they were just acting.

29:47.079 --> 29:50.700
Mr. Fan and Duoduo are just like-minded.

29:50.720 --> 29:52.339
They just have some chemistry.

29:52.359 --> 29:54.480
There's nothing else between them.

29:55.480 --> 29:58.359
So, they have some chemistry, huh?

30:00.720 --> 30:01.800
Your Highness!

30:02.280 --> 30:04.119
Where's your horse?

30:04.639 --> 30:07.119
I mean, where's your warhorse?

30:07.280 --> 30:08.480
It's at the entrance.

30:08.639 --> 30:10.059
May I take a look?

30:10.079 --> 30:11.260
Go ahead.

30:11.280 --> 30:13.119
Can you bring me there?

30:13.960 --> 30:15.040
Fine, then.

30:15.240 --> 30:17.720
I'll take him to see the warhorse.

30:32.839 --> 30:35.079
Your Highness, just be honest with me.

30:35.159 --> 30:37.040
Why exactly did you come here?

30:37.599 --> 30:39.170
Mother once told me

30:39.190 --> 30:41.800
that you will take over
the Imperial Treasury in the future.

30:42.480 --> 30:44.619
You have business dealings
with Northern Qi.

30:44.639 --> 30:47.700
Therefore, I have to protect you
with everything I have.

30:47.720 --> 30:48.619
Protect me?

30:48.639 --> 30:49.339
That's right.

30:49.359 --> 30:51.020
I came here to see Princess Lin

30:51.040 --> 30:53.420
so that I could
dispel the rumors for you.

30:53.440 --> 30:54.520
Come again?

30:57.040 --> 30:59.560
If so, I should thank you, then.

30:59.839 --> 31:01.030
Don't mention it.

31:04.190 --> 31:05.780
Your Highness, you don't
need to worry about me.

31:05.800 --> 31:07.159
I can deal with Wan'er

31:07.359 --> 31:08.760
myself.

31:10.760 --> 31:13.079
Are you sure you can do it yourself?

31:14.960 --> 31:16.220
Initially.

31:16.240 --> 31:17.439
I'm glad to hear that.

31:18.680 --> 31:21.020
Let's get back to business, then.

31:21.040 --> 31:22.359
Business?

31:24.319 --> 31:26.740
You and Li Chengze
are competing with each other.

31:26.760 --> 31:28.240
I've heard about it.

31:28.359 --> 31:30.359
We can help you out.

31:30.399 --> 31:31.479
"We?"

31:33.000 --> 31:34.819
You wanted to topple him

31:34.839 --> 31:39.480
because he colluded with Shen Zhong
for his smuggling business.

31:40.660 --> 31:42.900
I don't have enough evidence.
I can only punish the corrupt officials instead.

31:42.900 --> 31:44.090
We can create evidence.

31:44.110 --> 31:46.020
I can send a messenger pigeon
back to Northern Qi.

31:46.040 --> 31:47.660
I can give you all the evidence you want

31:47.680 --> 31:48.980
for their crime.

31:49.000 --> 31:50.639
I'll make sure he has no way
to explain himself.

31:50.639 --> 31:53.350
- Have you sent the messenger pigeon?
- Not yet. It depends on your timing.

31:57.079 --> 31:57.940
Your Highness,

31:57.960 --> 32:00.260
if you let Northern Qi send
evidence to us right now,

32:00.280 --> 32:03.720
I'll have no way
to explain myself, not Li Chengze.

32:04.159 --> 32:05.619
Why do you say so?

32:05.639 --> 32:07.399
The order is wrong.

32:07.680 --> 32:10.720
If I target him
after Northern Qi sends the evidence here,

32:10.720 --> 32:12.800
everything will make sense.

32:12.879 --> 32:14.500
Now, everyone knows

32:14.520 --> 32:15.760
that I've fallen out with him.

32:15.760 --> 32:18.960
Now, you want Northern Qi to cooperate with me
and send the evidence to me directly?

32:19.190 --> 32:20.740
What would other people think of me?

32:20.760 --> 32:22.679
I'll look like the traitor instead.

32:24.280 --> 32:27.720
That's truly a cause of concern.

32:27.919 --> 32:31.439
But how can we topple a prince

32:32.079 --> 32:34.899
without proving
that he colludes with the enemy?

32:34.919 --> 32:36.379
Your Highness, you don't need to worry.

32:36.399 --> 32:37.899
I'll come up with a solution myself.

32:37.919 --> 32:40.379
Just tell me if you need our help.

32:40.399 --> 32:41.879
Thank you so much.

32:45.080 --> 32:46.480
Since we're already here,

32:46.800 --> 32:48.220
where's your horse? Bring it here.

32:48.240 --> 32:48.980
Bring what?

32:49.000 --> 32:50.080
Your horse.

32:51.319 --> 32:53.119
Aren't you feeding it right now?

32:55.910 --> 32:57.200
This is your horse?

32:57.359 --> 32:58.420
This isn't a horse.

32:58.440 --> 32:59.610
How is it not a horse?

32:59.630 --> 33:01.100
This is the horse
I bought in the marketplace.

33:01.100 --> 33:03.320
It was galloping like the wind.

33:24.879 --> 33:27.180
I think Fan Xian

33:27.200 --> 33:28.680
did all that nonsense in Northern Qi

33:28.680 --> 33:29.980
to protect himself.

33:30.000 --> 33:31.339
Wan'er, don't worry.

33:31.359 --> 33:33.780
I'll beat him up for you
if there's something between him

33:33.800 --> 33:35.079
and the Holy Maiden.

33:36.119 --> 33:37.679
Thank you, Cousin Chengru.

33:37.960 --> 33:39.679
I wanted to ask you this just now.

33:39.800 --> 33:42.740
Can we actually buy a warhorse
in the marketplace?

33:42.760 --> 33:43.540
How is that possible?

33:43.560 --> 33:44.980
Buy a warhorse in the marketplace?

33:45.000 --> 33:46.539
Do the horse sellers have a death wish?

33:46.559 --> 33:48.020
If so, what did you guys buy?

33:48.040 --> 33:49.120
A mule.

33:49.159 --> 33:50.420
A mule?

33:50.440 --> 33:52.040
It can't gallop like the wind.

33:52.040 --> 33:53.260
It can only drag carts.

33:53.280 --> 33:55.800
If so, why did he say
that it was a warhorse?

33:57.040 --> 33:59.859
She kept saying that the royal family
of Northern Qi never owes favors.

33:59.879 --> 34:01.220
She insisted on buying a horse for me.

34:01.240 --> 34:03.579
I didn't want to spoil her mood.

34:03.599 --> 34:05.460
Why would she go
and buy a horse with you?

34:05.480 --> 34:07.639
To compensate me.
Didn't I tell you already?

34:07.800 --> 34:10.250
No, I mean, where are her guards?

34:10.270 --> 34:11.680
She doesn't need any guards
with me around.

34:11.680 --> 34:12.819
What about your guards?

34:12.839 --> 34:14.340
I came back from the battlefield.

34:14.360 --> 34:16.359
Why would I need guards
to walk on the streets?

34:16.399 --> 34:17.979
So, you asked her out alone,

34:17.999 --> 34:19.939
and she actually agreed to it?

34:19.959 --> 34:21.700
It's because she has
to buy a horse for me.

34:21.720 --> 34:22.919
What's the issue here?

34:23.039 --> 34:25.160
Nothing. It's great.

34:25.280 --> 34:26.360
I'm serious.

34:41.319 --> 34:45.999
Seems like he was duped
by the horse seller.

34:46.879 --> 34:48.919
Who was duped by the horse seller?

34:50.200 --> 34:51.399
Him.

34:51.720 --> 34:53.220
He's a prince, after all.

34:53.240 --> 34:54.499
I'm sure he's just like me.

34:54.519 --> 34:56.680
He's protected ever since his birth.

34:57.240 --> 34:58.620
Even if he did join the border army,

34:58.640 --> 35:01.180
I assume they won't
let him do anything dangerous.

35:01.200 --> 35:02.510
That's why he's just like me.

35:02.530 --> 35:04.240
We can't differentiate
between a mule and a horse.

35:04.260 --> 35:06.640
You actually came up
with an explanation for yourself?

35:09.680 --> 35:13.680
The descendants of the royal family
are quite helpless.

35:15.120 --> 35:16.479
Don't tell him about it.

35:16.640 --> 35:18.019
If not, he'll be embarrassed.

35:18.039 --> 35:19.540
You guys shouldn't tell her the truth

35:19.560 --> 35:21.540
if Fan Xian isn't talking about it.

35:21.560 --> 35:23.320
There's no need to make her embarrassed.

35:28.200 --> 35:29.060
What's wrong?

35:29.080 --> 35:30.919
I'm so envious.

35:32.720 --> 35:34.500
Sorry. We're a league apart.

35:34.520 --> 35:36.379
Chengru served in
the border army for many years.

35:36.399 --> 35:38.959
He's decisive and straightforward.
I cannot imitate him.

35:39.080 --> 35:40.720
I'm just boorish.

35:42.240 --> 35:43.220
Chengru,

35:43.240 --> 35:46.519
I look forward to you rendering
more military merit in the future.

35:47.519 --> 35:48.879
May that be true.

35:55.200 --> 35:56.479
However,

35:56.600 --> 35:59.780
if the Qing State does
go to war with Northern Qi again,

35:59.800 --> 36:01.979
Chengru, we have to depend
more on just your martial prowess.

36:01.999 --> 36:04.200
We have to depend on Mr. Fan as well.

36:04.439 --> 36:05.780
Forget about the Holy Maiden.

36:05.800 --> 36:07.120
Even the Crown Princess

36:07.120 --> 36:09.019
admires Mr. Fan.

36:09.039 --> 36:12.600
It seems that this trip
has been fruitful for him.

36:16.600 --> 36:18.340
Cousin Chengze, I'm happy

36:18.360 --> 36:19.879
that you visited me today.

36:20.039 --> 36:21.320
I also know

36:21.399 --> 36:24.999
that your true intention
wasn't to visit me in the first place.

36:25.359 --> 36:26.459
You're overthinking it.

36:26.479 --> 36:29.499
I know there's a storm
brewing in the court.

36:29.519 --> 36:33.399
Cousin Chengze, I also know
that Fan Xian is competing with you.

36:39.720 --> 36:40.879
Wan'er,

36:41.280 --> 36:42.600
all of this

36:42.960 --> 36:44.299
has nothing to do with you.

36:44.319 --> 36:45.479
Cousin Chengze,

36:45.720 --> 36:48.359
I grew up in the palace, after all.

36:48.399 --> 36:51.220
I know the way you do things.

36:51.240 --> 36:52.479
Every word you say

36:52.479 --> 36:54.140
and every action you commit

36:54.160 --> 36:56.160
has a reason behind them.

36:56.319 --> 36:57.700
Although you came here

36:57.720 --> 36:59.339
and spoke a lot today,

36:59.359 --> 37:01.280
you're just trying to express one thing.

37:01.670 --> 37:03.730
You intend to address
the issue from its roots.

37:05.359 --> 37:06.290
What do you mean?

37:06.310 --> 37:07.879
According to His Majesty's edict,

37:07.919 --> 37:11.280
those who marry me
will take over the Imperial Treasury.

37:11.720 --> 37:13.420
Cousin Chengze,
everything you said today,

37:13.440 --> 37:14.939
no matter if it was
Baoyue Pleasure House

37:14.959 --> 37:16.120
or the rumors in Northern Qi,

37:16.120 --> 37:18.160
your intention was for me
to harbor ill feelings for Fan Xian

37:18.160 --> 37:19.640
and cancel the engagement.

37:19.730 --> 37:21.560
Once Fan Xian loses the right
to the Imperial Treasury,

37:21.560 --> 37:24.039
naturally, he won't be able
to compete against you.

37:24.200 --> 37:27.439
Cousin Chengze, that's your true motive.

37:36.519 --> 37:37.899
So, to you,

37:37.919 --> 37:40.160
I'm only devious and cunning, huh?

37:40.479 --> 37:42.210
Seems like I have no feelings at all.

37:42.230 --> 37:43.640
Of course you have feelings.

37:43.760 --> 37:45.339
However, you hid them too deeply.

37:45.359 --> 37:46.800
No one can see them.

37:48.359 --> 37:49.879
This is the Capital.

37:50.359 --> 37:51.999
One's feelings

37:52.200 --> 37:54.120
should be kept hidden.

37:54.520 --> 37:56.120
I don't wish to keep them hidden.

37:57.560 --> 38:00.299
Cousin Chengze,
I'll tell you this today.

38:00.319 --> 38:03.959
I won't cancel my engagement
with Fan Xian.

38:17.240 --> 38:18.519
Since it has already come to this,

38:18.519 --> 38:20.200
I have nothing else to say.

38:20.439 --> 38:22.460
I shouldn't have come today.

38:22.480 --> 38:24.740
Cousin Chengze, you're welcome
to visit me at any time.

38:24.760 --> 38:26.959
But next time,
leave your plots and motives at home.

38:28.800 --> 38:30.200
Heroine Ye,

38:30.999 --> 38:32.760
do you still intend to kill me today?

38:42.240 --> 38:43.979
If so, I shall make a move first.

38:43.999 --> 38:45.959
Why didn't you ask me about it?

38:51.959 --> 38:53.120
What's wrong?

38:53.519 --> 38:55.800
Mr. Fan, do you
intend to kill me yourself?

39:00.680 --> 39:02.519
Can we have a toast?

39:24.839 --> 39:26.680
You poisoned my liquor?

39:36.160 --> 39:37.760
The Capital is full of people.

39:38.160 --> 39:39.640
People die every day.

39:40.080 --> 39:40.980
What else can I say

39:41.000 --> 39:42.600
besides lamenting their deaths?

39:42.879 --> 39:44.479
What else do you want me to say?

39:45.999 --> 39:47.320
I don't believe

39:48.439 --> 39:50.680
that you dare enough to kill me

39:51.560 --> 39:52.959
in front of them.

40:01.359 --> 40:02.760
What kind of poison is it?

40:04.920 --> 40:06.320
What kind of poison is it?

40:10.200 --> 40:11.640
Where's the antidote?

40:23.800 --> 40:25.700
Life is unpredictable.

40:25.720 --> 40:26.959
We

40:28.319 --> 40:29.959
should take it easy.

40:31.720 --> 40:34.080
That's what I learned today.

40:36.760 --> 40:38.879
It's pretty good, isn't it?

40:55.080 --> 40:57.660
Your Highness, it was just a joke.

40:57.680 --> 40:59.519
Did you actually believe me?

41:02.960 --> 41:04.080
Here.

41:04.560 --> 41:05.640
Take this.

41:09.280 --> 41:10.720
What is this now?

41:11.039 --> 41:14.479
What if I tell you that this
is the antidote? Will you believe me?

41:18.800 --> 41:19.880
Wan'er,

41:20.640 --> 41:22.120
let's not interrupt him.

41:40.479 --> 41:41.660
What an amazing show.

41:41.680 --> 41:42.939
This meal was worth it.

41:42.959 --> 41:44.700
If so, I won't bother you guys either.

41:44.720 --> 41:45.800
Let me see you off.

41:53.999 --> 41:55.839
Chengru!

41:57.640 --> 41:58.720
Chengru!

42:00.600 --> 42:02.359
Talk this over with Fan Xian.

42:02.879 --> 42:04.200
If it doesn't work out,

42:04.230 --> 42:05.919
you should try yielding to him.

42:17.720 --> 42:19.200
This is the poison.

42:19.280 --> 42:20.919
What? What did you say?

42:21.879 --> 42:23.120
This is the poison?

42:23.359 --> 42:24.340
How did you know?

42:24.360 --> 42:26.080
Fan Xian told me that personally.

42:27.720 --> 42:30.800
So, the liquor wasn't poisoned?

42:30.919 --> 42:32.320
This is the poison,

42:32.680 --> 42:33.760
right?

42:36.439 --> 42:37.640
Tell me!

42:39.280 --> 42:41.080
I don't know either.

42:52.519 --> 42:54.479
My life is hanging by a thread.

42:55.800 --> 42:58.479
It's been so long
since I felt such a thrill.

43:16.260 --> 43:18.260
♪ The youth raises his head ♪

43:18.260 --> 43:22.340
♪ As he moves toward his moon ♪

43:23.860 --> 43:25.980
♪ People tease him for being delusional ♪

43:25.980 --> 43:29.760
♪ Wondering why he is so unconventional ♪

43:31.780 --> 43:35.340
♪ Wearing a white robe
when crossing a muddy pond ♪

43:35.340 --> 43:39.260
♪ How could it remain unstained? ♪

43:39.260 --> 43:41.180
♪ If silver tael has a value ♪

43:41.180 --> 43:44.780
♪ Who can truly be carefree? ♪

43:45.500 --> 43:48.180
♪ All of you are right ♪

43:48.200 --> 43:50.420
♪ He said: "Please" ♪

43:50.420 --> 43:53.480
♪ "Make way" ♪

43:53.500 --> 43:55.980
♪ "Let me drink until I drop" ♪

43:55.980 --> 43:57.900
♪ On the court ♪

43:57.900 --> 44:00.920
♪ I recite several verses ♪

44:00.940 --> 44:03.340
♪ Let me wear a white robe ♪

44:03.340 --> 44:05.420
♪ And cross the alley
filled with insanity ♪

44:05.420 --> 44:08.640
♪ To scoop up the moon's reflection
in the muddy pond ♪

44:08.660 --> 44:10.900
♪ Sirs, please forgive me ♪

44:10.900 --> 44:12.860
♪ Your words of advice ♪

44:12.860 --> 44:15.880
♪ I understand,
but I don't want to pretend ♪

44:15.900 --> 44:18.190
♪ People search for the golden land ♪

44:18.190 --> 44:20.260
♪ While I search for the moon ♪

44:20.260 --> 44:22.720
♪ Why should we travel together? ♪

44:22.740 --> 44:24.660
♪ Thank you ♪

44:24.660 --> 44:26.740
♪ Excuse me ♪

44:26.740 --> 44:28.420
♪ You are you ♪

44:28.420 --> 44:30.320
♪ I am me ♪

44:30.340 --> 44:32.260
♪ Thank you ♪

44:32.260 --> 44:34.220
♪ Excuse me ♪

44:34.220 --> 44:36.020
♪ You are you ♪

44:36.020 --> 44:39.480
♪ I am me ♪

44:51.550 --> 44:54.770
♪ Wearing a white robe
when crossing a muddy pond ♪

44:55.150 --> 44:58.620
♪ Remarkably worldly-wise
yet hopelessly romantic ♪

44:58.870 --> 45:02.010
♪ Know what you love ♪

45:02.200 --> 45:04.770
♪ Don't change ♪

45:06.660 --> 45:10.090
♪ If one has witnessed
both light and shadow ♪

45:10.160 --> 45:13.790
♪ Yet retains their innocence ♪

45:13.810 --> 45:16.840
♪ They shall be cloaked in moonlight ♪

45:16.900 --> 45:20.100
♪ As they journey through the night ♪
